5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should ensure our choice is based on actual utility. I'll look into post-occupancy review ratings and survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with the need for data. I will check the booking data for specialist and general rooms and timetable records on rooms out of service.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the people maintaining these facilities. I'll examine staffing posts since the hiring freeze and bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We must be realistic about timelines. I'll investigate the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and weather days in the site diaries.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pragmatic approach to costs is essential. I'll review the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
