21,2,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
22,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
23,2,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
24,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"It seems our past successes are tied to shared accessibility, though older blocks hide hazardous surprises that cause delays.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"My findings show a desperate need for general-purpose space, while the cost of replacing rooms out of service is quite high.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,George,,"The grounds staff are depleted, but interestingly, the bench technicians are spending far too much time on manual equipment checks.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Weather is a significant risk for outdoor work, and projects based on ""comfort"" tend to slip their schedules significantly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Mechanical costs are rising sharply, and we have a worrying lack of reserves for replacing old audiovisual equipment.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we want a project that lands well, we should avoid isolated benefits and consider the risks of old partitions.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"That supports the idea of a general-use facility, provided we can manage the temporary loss of space.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,George,,"If the technicians are struggling with manual routines, an upgrade to their systems would be a huge relief.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,We should probably avoid outdoor projects if we cannot afford a year-long delay due to weather or shifting priorities.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree. Given the rising cost of plant equipment, we need to be very careful with any mechanical upgrades.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"So, we are balancing the need for shared space against the risks of construction delays and rising costs.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Victoria,,Exactly. A project that serves many users but minimizes outdoor exposure and complex mechanicals seems ideal.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,George,,But we cannot ignore the operational burden on the staff. The technicians' manual workload is a real issue.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we choose a project that is ""essential"" rather than ""comfort-based,"" it is more likely to be delivered on time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The lack of AV reserves also suggests that a media-focused project might be a financial trap without a funding plan.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I think we have enough information to evaluate the candidates once they are presented.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Let us see the options.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,George,,I'm ready.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,Me too.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let's proceed.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
