50,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"We have a ventilation upgrade, a study commons, a path network, and a media center. The commons aligns with high post-occupancy ratings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Victoria,,The study commons also addresses the shortage of general-purpose rooms I found in the booking data.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,George,,"The ventilation upgrade would solve the technicians' manual routine problems, which is a significant staff concern.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,The path network is too risky given the weather data and the tendency for outdoor works to slip.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"The ventilation upgrade is a ""finding"" based project, which Mizuki noted usually stays on schedule.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"True, but the study commons is an internal conversion, which also avoids the weather risks Mizuki mentioned.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,George,,The ventilation upgrade is a direct relief for the staff. The commons is just more space to manage.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"The media center would likely fall under ""comfort"" or ""appeal,"" making it prone to delays.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"Between the commons and the ventilation, the commons serves a wider variety of users.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,3,talk,Victoria,,And it solves the booking crisis. I strongly favor the Central Study Commons.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,George,,I still lean toward the Laboratory Ventilation Upgrade for the sake of the technicians.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Victoria. The Study Commons is a safer bet for the timeline and the budget.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I will vote for the Study Commons; the shared benefit is too strong to ignore.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,4,talk,Victoria,,My vote is for the Study Commons.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,4,talk,George,,I'll stick with the Ventilation Upgrade.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,Study Commons for me.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Given the rising cost of mechanical plant, the ventilation upgrade is a financial risk. I vote for the Central Study Commons.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
